{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>麻瓜們準備好魔法杖未？巡迴全球 16 個城市、吸引逾 200 萬人次朝聖嘅互動體驗活動「哈利波特：禁忌森林體驗」（Harry Potter: A Forbidden Forest Experience），宣佈將於 2026 年 12 月登陸韓國濟州島，近近哋都有得玩！今次活動選址濟州島著名的夜間光影公園「LunaFall」。在廣闊的自然森林環境中，透過燈光特效、音響與互動裝置，將電影中神秘莫測的禁忌森林完美還原。</p><p>參加者可以沿著夜光森林步道探索，途中不僅會遇見鷹馬（Hippogriff）、獨角獸及嗅嗅（Niffler）等奇幻生物，仲可以親手揮動魔杖施展咒語、召喚專屬的守護神！結合濟州島獨特嘅森林地貌與沉浸式光影科技，為魔法迷打造絕無僅有的冬夜奇幻之旅，各位哈利波特迷要準備好了！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767375040618756_13977701406a8dbc9732555.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767375318494991_9695555956a8dbc99b629c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767375545732345_7584521826a8dbc9c1e238.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767375754793510_12663870506a8dbc9e6635c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767376011513352_15881283156a8dbca158d68.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178767376367854243_17143307506a8dbca475a8f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T16:06:08.968025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":414,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}